Subject: RE: Unpaid invoices 18751 and 18908

Invoice 18908 is for work which should have been performed by VAS without charge under the warranty which applied to the CVE furnace.

More generally, we do not accept any liability to VAS while the Abar remains out of service. On 15 June 2021, during a negative pressure cycle, pressure unexpectedly reached 3 bar and, when the Air Admit Valve was opened in accordance with your operating manual, a filter was ejected from the air admit outlet at speed. Vacuum Furnace Solutions, in its report of 3 September 2021, identified a number of problems with your refurbishment and costed the remedial works at £12,850. We hold VAS responsible for the defective refurbishment of the Abar.

